[1m[38;5;231mHow long should the user id persist?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153msessionStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mSurvives reloads and navigation; cleared when the tab closes. Bounded exposure, easy to widen later.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m localStorage
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restart indefinitely. 'Log in once', but needs explicit invalidation and has a much larger XSS [39m
     [38;5;246mexposure window.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Cookie
     [38;5;246mChoose only if the backend must read the id on every request. Cannot be HttpOnly when set from this app's JS.[39m
